Stack is Rules and regulation
    - stack is always varticle container

requirement Collection:
1) Need space sotring elements
2) Top pointer 0> index of last elements

what are operations:
1) push()           --> Insert
2) pop()            --> Delete
3) peek() / peep()  --> Look at value(index)
4) isEmpty()        --> check is stack Empty
5) isFull()         --> check is stack Full
6) stackTop()       --> Top most Element
7) display()        --> display the elements